WordPress 6.3+ (wp_enqueue_script with an $args array: strategy, in_footer). Needs the nonce filters from the headers recipe: core prints this script through wp_get_script_tag(), so it carries the request nonce and document.currentScript.nonce works. Remove any plugin that prints its own gtag/Analytics snippet (for example a Google tag plugin), or it will fire before consent. Name `consent` as an essential cookie in the project config; comment-form cookies need the consent too.
